# Lure of the Wildcat (Jeuno) (jeuno 90): Ajithaam in Upper Jeuno and twenty NPCs in Upper Jeuno, Ru'Lude Gardens, Lower
# Jeuno and Port Jeuno. The guard (ENABLE_TOAU 1, the default): a trade while available (no quest trade handler; his
# script's trade wants 300 gil and the quest completed: nothing); 10088 (the White Sentinel Badge, begun); Ajithaam's
# 10089 at Prog 0, 10090 with some bits, 10091 with all twenty (the badge taken, KEYITEM_LOST, completed: the White
# Invitation Card); each NPC's event once (its bit unset), then, with its bit set, nil: its script or default answers.
# Completed: no section; Ajithaam's script starts 10176 only from ToAU's President Salaheem (nothing here), so his
# default 10092 plays. #toau_off and #toau_fraction are the guard's other side, #mask the isFull edges, #ajithaam his
# replies' kinds (against his script), #kinds and #adolie the NPC events' kinds, #mid_event the finishes outside their
# states. Ru'Lude's second Crooked Arrow (17772719) is cutscene_only: the engine refuses a talk to it (no handler runs).
# The char is a WAR of level 20 at fame 0, so the other quests at these NPCs stay silent or lose to this quest's
# Progress events: Unlisted Qualities (Luto Mewrilah's available 10031, importantOnce: an Event; with bit 7 set it
# answers, and its cancel option leaves it available), Child's Play (Karl: not offered), Tenshodo Membership
# (Sutarara's script: completed only), Cook's Pride / The Kind Cardian (Naruru's script: its standard 98), Shami's 23,
# Sagheera's SAGHEERA_NO_LIMBUS_ACCESS (no event), Hinda's local var (161 / 10128). The Gobbiebag Part I's 43 at
# Bluffnix is a Progress event too (fame level 1, an inventory of 30): the two tie, the first in the list (10056) plays,
# and with bit 12 set 43 plays (option 1: not begun). Lower Jeuno's zone-in is the Mog House zone event 10094 (the warp
# answers it).
lists UpperJeuno/Ajithaam/onTrigger UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/10088 UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/10091 UpperJeuno/Sibila-Mobla/onTrigger UpperJeuno/Shiroro/onTrigger UpperJeuno/Luto_Mewrilah/onTrigger UpperJeuno/Renik/onTrigger UpperJeuno/Hinda/onTrigger RuludeGardens/Albiona/onTrigger RuludeGardens/Crooked_Arrow/onTrigger RuludeGardens/Muhoho/onTrigger RuludeGardens/Adolie/onTrigger RuludeGardens/Yavoraile/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Sutarara/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Saprut/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Bluffnix/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Naruru/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Gurdern/onTrigger PortJeuno/Red_Ghost/onTrigger PortJeuno/Karl/onTrigger PortJeuno/Shami/onTrigger PortJeuno/Rinzei/onTrigger PortJeuno/Sagheera/onTrigger
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-79.7,0,161.5 job=WAR lvl=20
item BoneChip
login
trade Ajithaam BoneChip x1     # available: no trade handler; his script's trade (300 gil, the quest completed): nothing
trigger Renik                  # available: no handler, Renik's default 168
finish
trigger Ajithaam               # ENABLE_TOAU 1: 10088
finish                         # the White Sentinel Badge, begun
trigger Ajithaam               # Prog 0: 10089
finish
trigger Renik                  # bit 8 unset: 10086
finish                         # bit 8
trigger Renik                  # bit 8 set: nil, 168
finish
trigger Ajithaam               # some bits: his last answer was the Event 10089, so the lookup tries his script first
                               # (UseFallback); it starts nothing (no ToAU mission), so the quest's 10090 plays
finish
trigger Sibila-Mobla           # 10083
finish                         # bit 5
trigger Sibila-Mobla           # bit set: nil; her default 98 (her script has no onTrigger)
finish
trigger Shiroro                # 10084
finish                         # bit 6
trigger Shiroro                # bit set: nil; his default 85
finish
trigger Luto_Mewrilah          # 10085 (Progress, above Unlisted Qualities' 10031 importantOnce)
finish                         # bit 7
trigger Luto_Mewrilah          # bit set: nil; Unlisted Qualities' 10031 (available)
finish option=1073741824     # cancelled: Unlisted Qualities stays available
trigger Hinda                  # 10087
finish                         # bit 9
trigger Hinda                  # bit set: nil; her script's 161
finish                         # her script: spokenHinda 1
warp -4.4,9,-30.4 RuludeGardens
trigger Albiona                # 10089
finish                         # bit 0
trigger Albiona                # bit set: nil; her default 146
finish
trigger Crooked_Arrow          # 10090
finish                         # bit 1
trigger Crooked_Arrow          # bit set: nil; his default 149
finish
trigger Muhoho                 # 10093
finish                         # bit 2
trigger Muhoho                 # bit set: nil; his default 152
finish
trigger Adolie                 # 10091
finish                         # bit 3
trigger Adolie                 # bit set: nil; her default 158
finish
trigger Yavoraile              # 10092
finish                         # bit 4
trigger Yavoraile              # bit set: nil; his default 118 (his script has no onTrigger)
finish
warp 31.2,-0.1,-1.1 LowerJeuno
trigger Sutarara               # 10055
finish                         # bit 10
trigger Sutarara               # bit set: nil; his script: nothing (Tenshodo Membership not completed); his default 208
finish
trigger Saprut                 # 10054
finish                         # bit 11
trigger Saprut                 # bit set: nil; his default 224
finish
trigger Bluffnix               # 10056 ties with The Gobbiebag Part I's 43: 10056, the first in the list
finish                         # bit 12
trigger Bluffnix               # bit set: nil; The Gobbiebag Part I's 43 (31, 0, 1)
finish option=1                # not 0: The Gobbiebag Part I not begun
trigger Naruru                 # 10053
finish                         # bit 13
trigger Naruru                 # bit set: nil; his script's 98
finish
trigger Gurdern                # 10052
finish                         # bit 14
trigger Gurdern                # bit set: nil; his default 112
finish
warp -95,0,-3.3 PortJeuno
trigger Red_Ghost              # 314
finish                         # bit 15
trigger Red_Ghost              # bit set: nil; Unlisted Qualities available: no handler; his default 34
finish
trigger Karl                   # 316
finish                         # bit 16
trigger Karl                   # bit set: nil; his default 58
finish
trigger Shami                  # 317
finish                         # bit 17
trigger Shami                  # bit set: nil; his script's 23
finish
trigger Rinzei                 # 315
finish                         # bit 18
trigger Rinzei                 # bit set: nil; his default 56
finish
trigger Sagheera               # 313
finish                         # bit 19: Prog 0xFFFFF
trigger Sagheera               # bit set: nil; her script's SAGHEERA_NO_LIMBUS_ACCESS (no event)
warp -79.7,0,161.5 UpperJeuno
trigger Ajithaam               # all twenty: 10091
finish                         # the badge taken, KEYITEM_LOST, completed: the White Invitation Card
trigger Ajithaam               # completed: no section; his script: nothing (no ToAU mission); his default 10092
finish
